{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，尤其S05只有18秒，却同时铺出多组未标“到时出现”的小字感受，容易让主线被淹没；个别感受词如“对生命的眷恋”“快感”也略显过度阐释。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用短行和加亮词把每段的情绪落点直接递给观众，感受词又能随音乐分时出现，因此边听边扫更容易抓住重点，也更容易感受到具体的音乐细节。X的完整因果句则把人物的顾虑、克制和转变连接得更顺，理解他为什么这样做，以及前后心理如何递进，会更稳一些。综合而言，Y的视觉层次、重点识别和音乐同步体验更有优势，但需要控制个别段落的信息密度和感受词的过度阐释。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9491ae2c-e8a3-4250-92e6-1a396ac97f75", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T162908304945Z", "elapsed_seconds": 164.844, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T16:31:53.151513+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "990ac3a61dd24d3faa1057d7540a97c81c1b69b6f75d7f28d7773d07c93b06c6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_w